      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS are delighted to present No. 41 New Bancroft Hall to the market — a spacious three-bedroom, top-floor apartment presented in immaculate condition, complete with wraparound balconies that flood the living space with natural light. Ideally positioned within the mature and ever-popular New Bancroft Hall development, this superb property offers generous and well-proportioned accommodation throughout. The location is second to none, with a wide range of schools, shops, parks and leisure facilities all within easy reach. Tallaght Village and The Square Shopping Centre are close by, along with excellent public transport links and convenient access to major road networks. No. 41 represents an excellent opportunity for first-time buyers, families and investors alike seeking spacious, well-presented accommodation in a highly convenient Dublin 24 location.\nBright, airy and exceptionally spacious, this fantastic three-bedroom apartment offers approximately 95 sq. m. of well-proportioned living accommodation within a secure and beautifully maintained development. Positioned on the top floor, No. 41 enjoys an excellent sense of privacy and is presented in turnkey condition throughout. Upon entering, you are greeted by a large and welcoming entrance hallway, along with a separate utility room providing additional storage and practicality. At the heart of the home is a cosy open-plan living and dining area, complemented by a fully fitted kitchen which is cleverly sectioned off to provide additional privacy while offering ample storage and preparation space. Balcony doors lead from the living area onto a superb, sun-drenched south-facing balcony — an ideal space for relaxing or entertaining while enjoying views towards the Dublin Mountains. There are three generous bedrooms, all benefiting from built-in wardrobes, with the master bedroom further enhanced by its own ensuite. A fully tiled family bathroom completes the accommodation. The bedrooms to the rear also enjoy direct access to a second private balcony overlooking the landscaped communal gardens, adding another fantastic outdoor space to this already impressive home. No. 41 further benefits from designated parking within the secure gated development. Additional features include gas-fired central heating, quality flooring throughout, generous room proportions, excellent storage and immaculate turnkey condition. This wonderful property is sure to appeal to first-time buyers, families and investors alike, particularly those seeking a spacious home in a mature, well-established and highly convenient location.\nContact RAY COOKE AUCTIONEERS today on 086 822 5318 or 01 908 9300 to arrange a viewing. Early interest is expected — don't miss out!\n\nFeatures;\n- c. 95 sq.m\n- 3 Bed/ 2 Bath top floor apartment\n-Spacious room proportions\n-Pristine condition\n-Within a secure gated development\n-Gas fired central heating\n-South facing orientation\n-BER B\n-Management fees c. 3,900 p/a\n-Convenient location\n-Designated parking\n-Prime for first time buyers & growing families\n-Bus routes & schools on your doorstep\n-Close proximity to Tallaght Village & The Square Shopping Centre\n-Within arm's reach of M50 & N7 motorway\n-Early viewing strongly advised!\n\nDirections: Eircode is D24 V592"
      },
